#: ../../concepts/index.rst:4
msgid "You can build a lot with the guides alone. These pages explain the few contracts that are worth understanding before you push the runtime further — what one request owns, when context changes, and which channel carries which message to your UI."
msgstr "只看指南也能做不少事情。这几页解释几个值得在进一步使用运行时之前弄清楚的约定：一次请求拥有什么、上下文何时变化，以及哪条通道把哪条消息送到你的 UI。"

#: ../../concepts/index.rst:12
msgid "Architecture and ownership"
msgstr "架构与归属"

#: ../../concepts/index.rst:16
msgid "What each object owns, and where your application's responsibility starts."
msgstr "每个对象各自拥有什么，以及你的应用从何处开始负责。"

#: ../../concepts/index.rst:22
msgid "The exact order of hooks, phases, and cleanup inside one request."
msgstr "一次请求内部钩子、阶段和清理的确切顺序。"

