msgid "If you only read one page before writing a stateful extension, read :doc:`lifecycle`; if you are wiring a UI, read :doc:`events`."
msgstr "如果写有状态的扩展前只能看一页，那就看\\ :doc:`lifecycle`；如果正在接入 UI，那就看\\ :doc:`events`\\ 。"

